<h3>Topical calcineurin inhibitors（ch192 交叉參考）</h3>
<ul>
<li><mark data-q="101-28">Topical tacrolimus 與 pimecrolimus 皆 <strong>contraindicated in Netherton syndrome</strong></mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.3524–3526</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="101-28">Tacrolimus ointment 應避免用於 premalignant skin lesions、infected skin 及接受 phototherapy 者；pimecrolimus 不應塗在 premalignant 或 malignant skin lesions、active infection 部位，或接受 phototherapy 的皮膚</mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.3525、p.3527</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="108-41">Pimecrolimus 1% cream：<strong>2 歲以上</strong> mild to moderate AD 的 second-line treatment</mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.3526</span></li>
</ul>
</section>
